f","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124500.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #124499 \n\n## Additional information\n\n`ComputeList.State` now keeps push constants size for pipeline, which we set at `compute_list_bind_compute_pipeline` stage if a new pipeline have different push constants size.\nThat way, we are able to compare push constants size of barrier state with state of pipeline it just rebound, inside `compute_list_add_barrier` stage, which is fixing the issue. We do not replay push constants if size unmatched or there is no constants.\n\nTested with MRP attached to the issue, error is gone.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124500/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}